---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+18435550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(843) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Air Duct Cleaning | Charleston SC" description="Professional air duct cleaning in Charleston, SC. Negative-pressure equipment, HEPA filtration, upfront pricing.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Air Duct Cleaning</h1>
      <p>Serving Charleston, James Island, Folly Beach &amp; the Lowcountry.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Our full air duct cleaning service removes dust, pollen, pet dander, and debris from supply and return ducts using commercial negative-pressure machines and agitation tools. HEPA filtration keeps the process contained.</p>
      <h2>What's Included</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Inspection of accessible ducts and air handler area</li>
        <li>Negative-pressure source cleaning of trunk lines</li>
        <li>Agitation of branch runs and register openings</li>
        <li>Cleaning of accessible registers and grilles</li>
        <li>Floor and furniture protection throughout</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Schedule Service</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day or next-day availability. Based at 775 Folly Rd d, Charleston, SC 29412.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
